---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { pagePath } from '../lib/paths';
---
<BaseLayout title="Services | Mill City Web Studio" description="Website design, development, hosting, and ongoing support for small businesses.">
  <section class="section-shell page-hero">
    <div class="eyebrow">Services</div>
    <h1>A practical website partner for a small business.</h1>
    <p>You don't need a giant agency engagement to get a polished, fast, professional website. The focus is the work your business actually needs.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section-shell service-list">
    <article><span>01</span><div><h2>Custom website design + build</h2><p>Strategy, structure, visual direction, development, responsive behavior, content implementation, launch, and the technical setup required to get your site live.</p></div></article>
    <article><span>02</span><div><h2>Website refresh</h2><p>For businesses with a site that feels dated, cluttered, slow, or difficult to use on mobile. Keep what works and rebuild what doesn't.</p></div></article>
    <article><span>03</span><div><h2>Hosting + deployment</h2><p>Modern static hosting, Git-based deployment, domain configuration, HTTPS, and a clean workflow for future changes.</p></div></article>
    <article><span>04</span><div><h2>Ongoing website care</h2><p>Content updates, service and price changes, image swaps, new sections, performance checks, and practical support after launch.</p></div></article>
  </section>

  <section class="section-shell process">
    <div class="eyebrow">How it works</div>
    <div class="card-grid three">
      <article><span>1</span><h3>Understand your business</h3><p>Your business, customers, goals, and what the website needs to accomplish.</p></article>
      <article><span>2</span><h3>Design + build</h3><p>We shape the look, structure, messaging, and build a professional site for both desktop and mobile views.</p></article>
      <article><span>3</span><h3>Launch + support</h3><p>We handle the details that get your site live and can continue supporting it after launch.</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-shell simple-cta">
    <div><div class="eyebrow">Not sure what you need?</div><h2>Ask us. We can help.</h2></div>
    <a class="button primary" href={pagePath('contact/')}>Submit a request</a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
